<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange finished narrowly mixed in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 35.41 to 6726.88.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 0.03 to 405.04.</p>
<p>The average price per share finished unchanged.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 1257 to 1256.</p>
<p>Volume was 524,994,520 compared with 531,295,510 on Tuesday.</p>
